# Slack #coding-agents (Cursor main agent)

Channel: **`#coding-agents`** (`C0A9L7AU5HS`)
https://sumegroup.slack.com/archives/C0A9L7AU5HS

Same Jobs as the **status board** (`status-board.mdc`). Slack is the
team-visible log. Chat/canvas do **not** show `확인됨`; Slack still
marks resolve with a check.

Do not invent a second job list.

## When a Job is born

If there is no parent thread for that Job yet, **post a new channel
message** (not a reply). That message is the thread root.

Parent text (keep Job = terminal title):

```
<short Korean what> — `Opus : <slug> (#N)`
```

or Grok / Explore the same way. Slack MCP as the signed-in Chase user
(same pattern as historical “다음을 사용하여 보냄 @Cursor” posts).

Then set the parent reaction to **`loading`**.

Do **not** open a thread for a Job that already has a live parent.

## Updates

Each material change = **one reply** on that thread. Do not edit the
parent into a changelog. Prefixes (existing desk voice):

| Prefix | When |
|--------|------|
| `working —` | doing the work |
| `5m —` | periodic snapshot (CI / MQ / leftover) |
| `steer —` | direction change |
| `HANDOFF —` | SHA / PR / leftover for the next owner |
| `closed:` | Chase stop / train ended |

One-shot. No poll loop just to write `5m —`.

## Reactions = board lane (on the **parent**)

| Board | Slack emoji (no colons) | When |
|-------|-------------------------|------|
| `지금` | `loading` | process still running |
| `스테이징` | `eyes` | finished, waiting Chase confirm |
| resolve | `white_check_mark` | Chase confirmed |

Move the lane reaction when the board lane moves. Drop `loading` when
leaving `지금`. `eyes` while in 스테이징/백로그. `white_check_mark`
only on resolve (Job then drops from chat/canvas).

## Non-goals

- Not a substitute for the chat status board
- Do not dump secrets / PEM / tokens
- Codex / Claude Code as main: ignore (Cursor-only)
